AmigaPython 2.7.18
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Python for classic AmigaOS (68020+), based on the final Python 2 release.

Original Amiga port (through 2.0): Irmen de Jong
Updated to 2.7.18: amigazen project

