@Node Troubleshooting "Troubleshooting"
@Next "License"
@Prev "Documentation"
@Toc "Main"

TROUBLESHOOTING

Libraries not found
  Keep lib/ beside Python, or ASSIGN Python: to this drawer.

bsdsocket.library / usergroup.library errors
  Start a TCP stack; install usergroup if you need those APIs.

Math co-processor required
  Use a soft-float build, or a binary matching your FPU.

Crashes on complex / recursive code
  Increase stack on the icon or Shell "Stack" command.

PIPE: / os.popen oddities
  Replace buggy l:queue-handler (e.g. HWGQueue from Aminet).

Workbench project freezes the machine
  Use a current AmigaPython build.  Project launch must not Lock()
  the project file while Workbench still owns startup locks; current
  releases open via CurrentDir(wa_Lock) + leaf name.

Report Amiga-specific bugs via amigazen project.

@EndNode


